          <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
            <name>TheGroupPageIsToUseMultipleCurrentAccounts</name>
            <id>2109</id>
            <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
              <name>GroupMultipleAccounts</name>
              <id>2110</id>
              <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
                <name>ExplanationMultipleInvoices</name>
                <id>2084</id>
                <title>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Keep several bank accounts in the enterprise. You can set this setting in section &quot;Master data and settings&quot; — &quot;Bank accounts&quot;.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>نگهداری چند حساب بانکی در سازمان. می‌توانید این تنظیم را در بخش &quot;داده‌های پایه و تنظیمات&quot; — &quot;حساب‌های بانکی&quot; انجام دهید.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Possibilità di fare più conti correnti in azienda. Per configurare, è necessario accedere alla sezione &quot;Informazioni sulle normative, riferimento e amministrazione — - &quot;conti bancari&quot;.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Możliwość prowadzenia kilku rachunków rozliczeniowych w przedsiębiorstwie. Aby  skonfigurować należy przejść do rozdziału &quot;Ustawienia&quot; - &quot;Rachunki bankowe&quot;.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Возможность ведения нескольких расчетных счетов на предприятии. Для настройки необходимо перейти в раздел &quot;НСИ и администрирование&quot; — &quot;Банковские счета&quot;.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>İşletmede birden fazla ödeme hesabı tutma olanağı. Ayarlamak için &quot;Master veri ve yönetim&quot; - &quot;Banka hesapları&quot; bölümüne git.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Tính năng ghi nhận nhiều tài khoản ngân hàng trong doanh nghiệp. Để thiết lập, hãy chuyển đến phân hệ &quot;Danh mục và quản trị&quot; - &quot;Tài khoản ngân hàng&quot;.</value>
                </title>
                <visible>true</visible>
                <enabled>true</enabled>
                <userVisible>
                  <common>true</common>
                </userVisible>
                <extendedTooltip>
                  <name>ExplanationMultipleInvoicesExtendedTooltip</name>
                  <id>2345</id>
                  <type>Label</type>
                  <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                  <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                  <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                    <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                  </extInfo>
                </extendedTooltip>
                <contextMenu>
                  <name>ExplanationMultipleInvoicesContextMenu</name>
                  <id>2085</id>
                  <autoFill>true</autoFill>
                </contextMenu>
                <type>Label</type>
                <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                <horizontalStretch>true</horizontalStretch>
                <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
                  <color>Style.NoteText</color>
                </textColor>
                <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                  <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                  <verticalAlign>Top</verticalAlign>
                </extInfo>
              </items>
              <visible>true</visible>
              <enabled>true</enabled>
              <userVisible>
                <common>true</common>
              </userVisible>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
