    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>LocalizationGroupSupportOfBankingAndTreasurySupportOfGovernmentContracts</name>
      <id>2581</id>
      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>DecorationSetUpSupportForBankingAndTreasurySupportOfGovernmentContracts</name>
        <id>2583</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Support of banking and treasury state contracts &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>پشتیبانی از قراردادهای دولتی بانکی و خزانه‌داری &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Поддержка банковского и казначейского сопровождения госконтрактов &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Devlet sözleşmelerinin bankacılık ve hazine takibi için destek &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Hỗ trợ ngân hàng và ngân quỹ theo hợp đồng chính phủ &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Support of banking and treasury state contracts &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>&lt;link Set up SUPPORT275FZ>Support of banking and treasury state contracts &lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>DecorationSetUpSupportForBankingAndTreasurySupportOfGovernmentContractsExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>2585</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Cash management of an enterprise that fulfills state contracts in accordance with the requirements of the banking and treasury support, as well as Federal Law No. 275-FZ.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>مدیریت وجه نقد سازمانی که قراردادهای دولتی را طبق الزامات پشتیبانی بانکی و خزانه‌داری و همچنین قانون فدرال شماره 275-FZ اجرا می‌کند.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Gestione dei fondi monetari dell'azione del partecipante per l'esecuzione delle commesse statali in conformità con i requisiti del monitoraggio bancario e di tesoreria, nonché con la Legge federale n. 275-FZ.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Zarządzanie środkami pieniężnymi przedsiębiorstwa uczęstnika wykonania kontraktów państwowych zgodnie z wymaganiami wsparcia bankowego i skarbowego, a także ustawy federalnej nr 275-FZ.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Управление денежными средствами предприятия участника исполнения государственных контрактов в соответствии с требованиями банковского и казначейского сопровождения, а также федерального закона №275-ФЗ.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Bankacılık ve hazine desteğinin gerekliliklerine ve Federal Kanunun 275 sayılı federal yasaya uygun olarak devlet sözleşmelerinin yürütülmesine katılan bir işletmenin nakit yönetimi.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Quản lý tiền của doanh nghiệp tham gia thực hiện hợp đồng chính phủ theo yêu cầu hỗ trợ ngân hàng, ngân quỹ và quy định của luật pháp.</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <maxWidth>86</maxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <horizontalStretch>true</horizontalStretch>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
