          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>ControlExcessOfCashFlowLimits</name>
            <id>2260</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Control limit excess</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>کنترل تجاوز از حد</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Controllare il superamento dei limiti</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Kontroluj przekroczenie limitów</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Контролировать превышение лимитов</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Limit aşımlarını kontrol et</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Kiểm soát vượt hạn mức</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>ConstantsSet.ControlExcessOfCashFlowLimits</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>ControlExcessOfCashFlowLimitsOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>ControlExcessOfCashFlowLimitsExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>2371</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>When the limit is exceeded, it is prohibited to post payment requests in statuses &quot;Opened&quot;, &quot;Approved&quot;, and &quot;Scheduled&quot;.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>هنگام تجاوز از حد، ثبت قطعی درخواست‌های پرداخت در وضعیت‌های &quot;باز&quot;، &quot;تأییدشده&quot; و &quot;زمان‌بندی‌شده&quot; ممنوع است.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Quando si supera il limite di non possesso delle richieste di consumo in stato &quot;Non allineata&quot;, &quot;Concordato&quot; e &quot;A pagamento&quot;.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Przy przekroczeniu limitu zostanie zabronione księgowanie wniosków na wydatkowanie o statusie &quot;Nieuzgodniony&quot;, &quot;Uzgodniony&quot; i &quot;Do płatności&quot;.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>При превышении лимита запрещается проведение заявок на расход в статусах &quot;Не согласована&quot;, &quot;Согласована&quot; и &quot;К оплате&quot;.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Limitin aşılması halinde &quot;Onaylanmadı&quot;, &quot;Kabul edildi&quot; ve &quot;Ödeme için&quot; durumlarında gider taleplerinin işleme alınması yasaktır.

</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Nếu vượt quá hạn mức, sẽ không được phép kết chuyển giấy đề nghị thanh toán có trạng thái &quot;Chưa thống nhất&quot;, &quot;Đã thống nhất&quot; và &quot;Cần thanh toán&quot;.

</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <horizontalStretch>true</horizontalStretch>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
